.env
data/
# The memory MCP's mutable working set — personal reflection, promoted into
# data/notes.jsonl by sync and never committed.
.claude/memory.jsonl
# Per-machine Claude Code settings (enabled MCP servers) — local by convention.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Raw Apple Health exports. Large (~35 MB zipped, ~750 MB of XML inside), and
# personal. They are a delivery mechanism, not a store: `flow sync --signals`
# extracts the workout and body rows into data/signals.jsonl and then purges the
# file. Nothing here should ever be committed or kept around.
ingest/
!ingest/README.md
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
docs/screenshots/*.png
reports/
neo4j/
.dagster_home/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
# Stan compile artefacts: cmdstanpy caches executables beside the model files.
models/*
!models/*.stan
!models/README.md
